273
00:32:27.584 --> 00:32:28.585
Mike?

274
00:32:29.962 --> 00:32:31.171
Mike, thank god!

275
00:32:32.005 --> 00:32:33.131
You have to be careful, Abby,

276
00:32:33.465 --> 00:32:34.925
